{"synopsis":"Sementara yang lain bertransmigrasi dan terikat pada sistem, bekerja seperti budak. Wang Yang bertransmigrasi dan memiliki sistem PUA yang melakukan semua pekerjaan untuknya! Selama dia berbaring (tang ping), apa pun yang dia inginkan akan dikabulkan oleh sistem. Keterampilan tingkat dewa, kultivasi yang tak terkalahkan, gadis-gadis cantik——semuanya dalam jangkauan! Transmigrasi seharusnya menyenangkan!","alternative_title":"卑微系统，跪请我无敌","author":"九川动漫","artist":"九川动漫","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"18753773-f6c7-48a1-8725-5ef0997a12cf","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2025-05-17","released":"2025-05-17"},{"chapter_id":"9c407495-bd59-41e1-9f9c-0a91914c6454","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2025-05-13","released":"2025-05-13"},{"chapter_id":"b426ae29-a8c5-4d78-bf98-02f67c9a085d","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2025-05-04","released":"2025-05-04"},{"chapter_id":"94dd1d5f-ce6a-4340-9d93-7e511db7d63d","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2025-04-26","released":"2025-04-26"},{"chapter_id":"ee5e9715-2f54-4f0a-abe1-a03254ee32f2","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2025-04-20","released":"2025-04-20"},{"chapter_id":"19ffe908-6fc7-4a6f-94db-8786029de2c7","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2025-04-20","released":"2025-04-20"},{"chapter_id":"1734fde6-249d-41c1-b25b-6d062bb59880","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2025-04-19","released":"2025-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"8785282a-6873-4819-ab52-2a6fc59c307c","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2025-04-19","released":"2025-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"40af20d7-bc31-4a03-8263-a913e87f368a","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2025-04-06","released":"2025-04-06"},{"chapter_id":"eb6b15a2-1fbf-438a-8cd3-f17df87cdc7f","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2025-04-06","released":"2025-04-06"},{"chapter_id":"4b4d972f-a460-42fa-bbd8-b253917fb207","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2025-04-06","released